# Binary test fixtures — skip line-ending normalization, suppress diffs,
# force binary merges. `binary` is a macro for `-text -diff -merge`.
# Staying off Git LFS: fixtures are <200 KB, low-churn (re-recorded only
# when prompts change). Revisit if a single fixture exceeds 1 MB or
# fixtures churn on most PRs. See design/image-generation.md → Testing.
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
